# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# `macos/.gitignore` covers the Swift build products; these are the leftovers
# that a restructure can strand at the root. They are build output, not source,
# and must never reach a commit.
.DS_Store
.build/
.swiftpm/
build/
DerivedData/

# Stray files from ad-hoc shell work. If one of these turns out to be real
# source, it belongs in a directory with a README, not loose at the root.
l
*.icns